  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Je n\u2019ai rien dit de m\xE9chant.\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - " Ah oui ? \u201CT\xE9a t\u2019en met du temps\u201D, \u201CT\xE9a elles sont
      bizarres tes cicatrices\u201D, \u201CT\xE9a c\u2019est le bazar par i\xE7i\u201D,
      tout \xE7a c\u2019est pas m\xE9chant peut \xEAtre ?\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Pardon je ne pensais pas\u2026"
